<title>USA: Access TV IPO postponed.</title>
<headline>Access TV IPO postponed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The initial public offering of Access TV Network Inc has been postponed indefinitely said a representative for Southcoast Capital Corp, lead underwriter for the deal.</p>
<p>The IPO was slated for the week of November 4. The representative could not offer information on terms or when the IPO will resurface.</p>
</text>
